SEQUENCE:214667905
SUMMARY:✅ Falcon 9 · Bandwagon 5 (Dedicated Mid-Inclination Rideshare)
DTSTART:20261020T110400Z
DTEND:20261020T120400Z
LOCATION:Space Launch Complex 40\, Cape Canaveral SFS\, FL\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Status: Launch Successful\nWindow: Tue\, 20 Oct 2026 10:30:00 U
 TC – Tue\, 20 Oct 2026 11:30:00 UTC\nWeather: 95% GO\nOrbit: Low Earth O
 rbit\nPad: Space Launch Complex 40\, Cape Canaveral SFS\, FL\, USA\n\n▶ 
 Watch live: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJmcwHwxip0\n\nDedicated rides
 hare flight to a mid-inclination orbit with dozens of small microsatellite
 s and nanosatellites for commercial and government customers.\n\nThis laun
 ch also carries the second demonstration mission for SpaceX’s Project St
 arfall\, which aims to mass-produce reentry capsules designed to autonomou
 sly transport valuable customer experiments and other payloads safely back
  from space to Earth\, including for in-orbit manufacturing. \n\nStarfall 
 is a cylindrical shaped capsule approximately 0.75 meters tall with a diam
 eter of 3.1 meters\, weighing approximately 2100 kilograms\, and capable o
 f carrying 1000 kilograms of payload. It is designed to be carried on Star
 ship flights.\n\nCountdown & updates: https://benjaminowens612.github.io/s
 pacex-launch-alerts/#3b430f81-0ff1-4d85-8a1a-cef0de326198
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJmcwHwxip0
CATEGORIES:other
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
